    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Operations Links & SLO Policy",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Availability objective:** 99.9% over a rolling 30-day window. The error budget is 0.1% of requests. Alerts cover readiness, sustained 5xx rate, p95 latency, multi-window error-budget burn, and process CPU/RAM.\\n\\n- [Prometheus Alerts](http://localhost:9090/alerts) · [Alertmanager](http://localhost:9093) · [Mailpit Email Inbox](http://localhost:8025)\\n- Trigger a controlled local 500 with `curl http://localhost:8080/__test__/error`. This route exists only when `KAVIONT_ENV=local` or `test`."
      }
    }
